/-! The literal degree-100 HS relation supplies a certified cubic-centralizer
bound. Individualization and neighbor-color refinement bound the full graph
centralizer by 720. Eight checked inner conjugators fuse the nonidentity
Sylow-three elements; Sylow conjugacy extends the bound to every cubic.
Source: ATLAS HSG1-p100B0, used in Aschbacher–Smith 2.4.25, p.543. -/
public section
open Subgroup
open scoped Pointwise
